{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-16_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-16","title":"挺起胸膛","storyCode":"13-18","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"b1d0f4fd28caa97650f3a32f058f3f58f118131a59a23ec85ed5e51406cd27d9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"伦蒂尼姆城中，莱托告别了自己的战友，看望了永不能升为老近卫军的老人，最终来到血魔大君的面前。虽然无法杀死血魔大君，但莱托选择将自己卑劣的血溅向他。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的衣柜中，专门有一个抽屉用来收藏勋章。\n我在西尔军事学院毕业时拿到的纪念章，城防军的服役十五年奖章，还有四年前城内的混乱平息后，市议会为我颁发的伦蒂尼姆自由奖章。\n抽屉的更深处，是家族中传下来的那些属于旧时代的遗存。老近卫军的帽徽，林贡斯的一片残砖，科西嘉一世陛下亲令赏赐的金杯。\n那只金杯如今已经断成两截，上边的雕花也都模糊不清了，不过，我仍记得每道花纹的走向，每个浮雕人物的表情。\n那是我的父亲母亲、我的叔叔婶婶们，他们心心念念的，高卢的辉煌，不可被剥夺，也永不会暗淡的辉煌。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那只金杯相当有分量，你应该能拿那东西卖个好价钱，高卢艺术品的行情一直不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是把那东西熔了，当金子卖，也够你随便挑个城市，在最好的地段买上间公寓了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我住处的钥匙，收好了，东西就在衣柜里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另去选个地方，重新开始生活吧。你可以把今年的这些事，仅仅当作偶然之间做的一场噩梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，是您在那帮萨卡兹追我的时候帮了我一把，是您把我藏在城防军的办公室里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我该感谢您，我早就不是城防军的成员了，也不是您的高卢同胞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您没必要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是在屋子里还看上了其他什么东西，也通通可以拿走。那些纪念品对于我已经没什么意义了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在局势重新安稳下来之前，你最好继续躲在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军事委员会已经解除了城防军的武装，你现在在那些萨卡兹的眼里，和维多利亚的平民没什么区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们的战友们还在外面，他们有些，呃，不安分，我想把大家都救回来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲手把他们抓起来交给了军事委员会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他眼中的愤怒还未达到顶点便早早地泄了气。\n一如我过去对他的评价，一个懦夫，也许他作战时有那么一点胆量，但终究还是个懦夫。\n他在这里与我苟且偷生，他永远比不上那些反抗萨卡兹的战士们。\n永远也比不上。\n......\n我比得上吗？\n哈哈。\n我......不在乎。\n我早就不在乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防军成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您接下来......要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君已经等了我很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待在这，等一切结束之后再离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想活下去，就最好祈祷到时候推开门，外面欢呼的人是维多利亚人而不是魔族佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n欢呼的维多利亚人......\n我第一时间想到的竟然还是维多利亚会胜利。\n不，也许只是惯性使然。我当然希望特雷西斯会赢，这才是他承诺重建高卢的前提。\n我一切的牺牲，我一切的背叛，我一切再也无法被饶恕的罪孽，都是为了高卢。\n是啊，我是为了......高卢。\n但愿如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"成群的人被萨卡兹的军队押送着，走向远处的城墙。\n萨卡兹想把伦蒂尼姆加固成他们的堡垒，恐怕最终的决战就在眼前。\n他们打算固守这座维多利亚的首都？也许吧。\n队伍里有些人对我投来愤恨的目光，我认识他们，我们曾经......把酒言欢。\n没有人阻拦我，萨卡兹并不在乎我去往何处。\n被豢养的羽兽，就算打开笼门，它又能飞去哪儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勒内·莱托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到能这样和你接触。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许这是个好的讯号，至少你还没被萨卡兹处死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时间聊聊吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我认出你了......你是，自救军的那个小领袖克洛维希娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军的据点都已经被我们清剿干净，剩下的人也应该全部撤出了伦蒂尼姆，你为什么还在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了城防军的手下留情，也多亏了开斯特的信守承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的“灰礼帽”们确实保证了自救军顺利撤出这座将死的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开斯特公爵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我早就对你的身份有所猜测，不过现在，不论你是哪位阁下的附庸或傀儡，我都不关心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你的本事到底有多大，但现在的伦蒂尼姆不适合一个造反的孩子到处游荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回你之前躲着的地方吧，趁还没被萨卡兹们逮到，我可以当作没看见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你躲在伦蒂尼姆已经够久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和自救军失散以后，尽可能快地在伦蒂尼姆内重新找到了行动的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也......遭到了背叛。我甚至还不清楚叛徒具体有哪些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我没有时间想这些，城内的情况远远超过了我们对“占领移动城市”的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在发生的事，你在历史书上，找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比谁都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你看过城外的情况吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到萨卡兹的法阵，红光冲天而起，我看到形态各异的战争装置，绝非寻常国家的制式装备可比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到巫师悬浮于半空，主宰领空，使得所有形式的无人机与源石技艺统统失效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为那些描述萨卡兹军队和那个所谓的“食腐者”的传说，多少都是些添油加醋来徒增恐怖色彩的文学手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不再这么想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当死亡本身敞开大门，我们要面临什么样的人间地狱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公爵的军队。坚硬，宏伟，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在地平线的那头。他们遥不可及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜测，你此时此刻，是不是心中怀着歉疚与悲哀，但又夹杂着一点点自豪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，你做了许多残忍的选择，但是现在，你的使命完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜测，你向特雷西斯提出了一个交易，而特雷西斯答应了，有关那些曾经属于高卢的移动城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆太小，装不下萨卡兹的野心，他不过借着这里撩拨泰拉诸国蠢蠢欲动的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的觉得他在乎你和你的高卢吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的伦蒂尼姆已经彻底沦陷，但你不是蠢货，你看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔军事委员会根本没有占领维多利亚的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不傻。我从一开始，就没有把希望寄托在特雷西斯的允诺上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是参与了那么多手足相残的悲剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想创造机会？就像萨卡兹们正在为卡兹戴尔做的事情一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，这场将所有公爵的精力耗干的战争，将成为高卢的幽灵再度返回人间的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但问题在于——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你真的相信吗，勒内·莱托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还能相信什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经承认我的懦弱了，你还需要我承认我的愚蠢，我的绝望，我的毫无意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想找我干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军，那些反抗萨卡兹，在维多利亚可笑的贵族之间挣扎求生的人，都还有一线生机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你所奢求的所谓的“高卢”，可能也存在于那一线生机之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......高卢啊，高卢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你是一位仍旧愿意抗争的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你们这样的人而言，就算是尘埃里的废墟，也能成为下一座壁垒的基石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都是这样的人，你，军事委员会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们如此强大，强大到能颠覆国家，操弄历史，更遑论......一两个我这样的人的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下你的自怨自艾吧，在地狱降临之前，我们还有很多可以做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你当作赎罪还是当作另一次抗争的开始，我都无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托，我希望我们能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，了不起的人啊，你能告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该如何拯救自己吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧，你也没有主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不打算回头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么我也不会祝福你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你背负着那么多人的死，我的同僚们的死，你却做出了令人不齿的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勒内·莱托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。快逃吧，萨卡兹就要来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还得......去告别呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g11_victoriaroom_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"这林贡斯浸透我们的眼泪♪\n战场充满了苦与累♪\n但那一天总会来到♪\n要判处侵略者死罪♪\n要判处侵略者死罪♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个住在城里的“老近卫军”。\n我怎么在这个时刻最先想起他呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你，的番，号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您顶在我腰间的木棍依然如此有力，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闭，嘴！报......出你的番号！士兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林贡斯青年近卫军第二近卫腾跃兵团，莱托下士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我的，部队？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，您的部队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我没，见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您见过，您只是忘了，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝陛下，命，令我在这里养伤，但我，还是想知道，前线，的，战况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"邪恶，的巫王被我们的舰队，摧毁了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我在电视里，看，到了维多利亚的大，大，大胡子公爵的军队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他，们也想趁机忤逆，皇帝陛下吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，伦蒂尼姆已经陷落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我会被擢为......老，近卫军！你，还不到，时候！你，还需证明，自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他已经快九十岁了。他早就已经糊涂到几乎忘记了一切。\n几十年来，他的记忆依旧停留在高卢人追随科西嘉一世出征莱塔尼亚的黄金盛世。\n护士总是说他会在明年去世，但他还是挺到了如今。\n挺到了高卢都已成了历史。\n挺到了伦蒂尼姆都已经将要走进坟墓。\n......\n我在离开城防军的岗位前，下达的最后一项命令，是保证这座疗养院的安全。\n这是我在漫长的城防军服役期间，为我自己做的唯一一件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给您带了林贡斯产的兰斯香槟，您的最爱。请坐下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"酒很好，下士，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这林贡斯浸透我们的眼泪♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"战场充满了苦与累♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......要判处侵略者死罪......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在唱这首歌的时候，就好像所有的病痛和衰老都不曾存在一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们的旗帜永远辉煌♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未见过林贡斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾和我无数次说起那些华伟的殿堂，那些发达的路网......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您还记得戈尔丁吗，那个很多年前，曾经和我一起来拜访您的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她为这个残酷的，无法撼动的，沾满了鲜血的时代而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，是造就这一切的凶手之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对她......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她已经离去了。她不在我的视野里，她不再看向我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......很害怕，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个叫阿米娅的孩子告诉我，我的所作所为都是因为懦弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾向戈尔丁自白，我只是想在接踵而至的毁灭中活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我仍然希望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是借口，我也仍然希望——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片废墟中会有新的高卢人站起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望戈尔丁能继续教那些孩子，在阳光，和花香里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的坚持真的很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我，可我却是那个......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经做了我能做的一切。这很累，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得我们还有未来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......\n原来他早就睡着了。\n也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我抽出我的佩剑。曾属于高卢人的剑。\n我想......也许让他在萨卡兹闯入这里以前，停留在梦里会更好。\n那起码会是一个灿烂的梦。\n......可我这样卑劣的人，岂敢伸手玷污——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n已经老去的青年近卫军的血，溅满了我的双手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"统御鲜血的君主，血魔大君，他正静静望着维多利亚宫廷中华贵的装饰。\n他脸上的表情，甚至称得上......恬静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了，莱托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会找个地方躲起来呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，当然不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会来找您的，大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天打扮得很精神，很好。自从你认识的那个高卢老师死后，你一直都是副垂头丧气的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的孩子们打过赌，他们猜你就快死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是相信你的，莱托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪我喝一杯吧，庆祝你的仇敌，这个叫维多利亚的国家的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲手开启仪式，赠予它最古老的诅咒，最悲哀的终局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就要出发了。连我的族裔们都无此殊荣，你真该庆幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君，您知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我出生的时候，高卢的首都就已经被威灵顿公爵和他卑劣的同谋彻底毁灭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座城市毁灭了，如同一声叹息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，您似乎要对伦蒂尼姆，做同样的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这令你唏嘘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......没有想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威灵顿公爵拆毁了林贡斯，瓜分了那些移动地块。呵，可笑又无趣的维多利亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想亲手了结你的血仇吗？我赞许你的执着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实可以赐你这样的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您致谢，大君。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我深深地低下头颅。但我能感觉到他的视线停留在我的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......多可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙，善变，懦弱，自以为是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会因为恐惧祈求怜悯，又因为绝望而自取灭亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还是很好奇，你啊，你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你渺小的生命中，我们相处的时间已经不短了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你真的以为你能杀我，莱托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我自己的血，攥住了我自己的心脏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也许会想，这个萨卡兹是何等傲慢，对自己何等蔑视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反......莱托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我即将看见的事物，我对你，充满，怜爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确愚蠢，卑劣，你该珍惜你的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为，它们能有些更有趣的用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我们之间，仓皇的告别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"高卢人的剑......我竭尽全力摸索着。\n卑劣者的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的人。再努力些，再挣扎些，你就快碰到剑柄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......赐予......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剑刃划过我的脖子，冰凉，冷冽。\n我看见我肮脏的血从颈间喷涌而出。\n这些猩红的液体沾湿了他的衣裳，溅上了他的脸。\n哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，我“赐予”你我的血，臭蛭虫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再也没法夸耀你纯净的血液了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为卑鄙的勒内·莱托污染了它！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
